  Bugtracker: L<https://rt.cpan.org/Public/Dist/Display.html?Name=Sub-Quote>
  
  Git repository: L<git://github.com/moose/Sub-Quote.git>
  
  Git browser: L<https://github.com/moose/Sub-Quote>
  
